    "en": {
      "trackName": "Gomoku Chess For Watch",
      "description": "Gomoku: Apple Watch Edition\n\nChallenge your strategic skills with Gomoku! This classic board game, specially designed for Apple Watch, offers a rich gameplay experience with both single-player AI mode and multiplayer mode. Whether you’re a beginner or a Gomoku expert, you can choose from various difficulty levels to push your limits and improve your skills.\n\nGame Features:\n\t•\tSingle-player AI Mode: Battle against a smart AI with selectable difficulty levels, ranging from easy to hard, to gradually enhance your gameplay.\n\t•\tMultiplayer Mode: Compete with friends or players from around the world in real-time, testing your strategic thinking to win the game.\n\t•\tMultiple Language Support: Choose from a variety of languages to suit your preferences.\n\t•\tOptimized for Watch: A sleek and intuitive interface designed for the Apple Watch screen, so you can enjoy Gomoku anytime, anywhere.\n\nJoin the challenge and become a Gomoku master!",
      "releaseNotes": "bug fixes",
